      "context_excerpt": "PepsiCo is an early adopter, working with Siemens and NVIDIA to convert selected U.S. manufacturing and warehouse facilities into high‑fidelity 3D digital twins that simulate end‑to‑end plant operations and supply chains. Using Siemens’ Digital Twin Composer , PepsiCo can recreate every machine, conveyor, pallet route and operator path with physics‑level accuracy, enabling AI agents to simulate and refine system changes and identify up to 90% of potential issues before any physical modifications occur.",
